Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.50,1:31:30.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《进击的巨人》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.15,0:00:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,百年以前，突然出现的巨人们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃掉大半的人类，导致文明崩毁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.91,0:00:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这场巨人大战残存的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了抵抗巨人的侵略
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,筑起了三重巨大的高墙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,以确保墙内安定和平的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是，高墙虽然耸立已过百年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.28,0:00:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而今却无人能保证高墙不会崩坏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,又被开除了…真拿这孩子没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连？又？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.94,0:00:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是伤脑筋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.48,0:01:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤脑筋伤脑筋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸，不好意思，我出去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.97,0:01:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去找艾连吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去跟他说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.61,0:01:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经没工作可以介绍给他了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去一下就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好劝他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.35,0:01:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定又在山丘那儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.49,0:01:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意安全喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以给我一点芥花油吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年芥菜收成挺不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.50,0:01:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,满满一桶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.35,0:01:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.11,0:01:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔敏，你上次做给我的坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.43,0:01:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再帮你修好它
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.54,0:02:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,要快一点修好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.18,0:02:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.42,0:02:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有看到米卡莎吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.79,0:02:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.23,0:03:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为没人会靠近这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.67,0:03:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.51,0:03:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用怕啦，这是未爆弹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.66,0:03:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一爆炸了怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆了就爆啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.71,0:03:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起被炸成灰烬就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.39,0:03:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你又被开除了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次才一个月耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:04:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,比之前警卫的工作久了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么每份工作你都做不久啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.15,0:04:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你光继承家里的店就满足了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个，是靠电池运作的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.51,0:04:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,电池？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做出更多这样的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是做太多小心被逮捕喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎，你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我？ - 对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.39,0:05:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,内地有超多豪宅跟有钱人对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多这种乡下地方没有的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.44,0:05:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你们不想去看看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不然墙外的世界呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在墙内出生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.31,0:05:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道也要死在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.65,0:05:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样真的好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就像是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这颗未爆弹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.33,0:06:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大海
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,大海？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.84,0:06:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前说过超多水的那个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.81,0:06:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的蓝色，就是大海啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大海？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.85,0:06:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来真的存在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是池塘吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.89,0:06:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,比那还要大上几亿倍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙的外面真的有那种东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是跟你们说过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只鸟应该见过大海的模样吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去看看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是保护人们而是守护墙壁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这工作真是烂透了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.58,0:07:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点过来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.59,0:08:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.48,0:08:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次这么近看这高墙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用急着现在出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要什么时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,攀墙的话是会被当场处死的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且听说墙外到处都是巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.10,0:09:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有大炸弹，只有巨人能存活
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.87,0:09:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人这种鬼话你们真的相信？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百多年了根本也没人看过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们依然害怕的躲在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定高墙的另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是乐园呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！你们在干嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙想造反吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.13,0:09:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我过来 - 过来，不准反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在干嘛？ - 这里禁止进入
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.81,0:09:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好痛 - 不准碰米卡莎！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这是干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.59,0:09:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔敏，不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好适可而止！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.21,0:10:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是一点也没变啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.28,0:10:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,索达大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.53,0:10:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以走了，喂！都只是孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以是想在她面前耍帅吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是咧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.55,0:10:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是小鬼的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.09,0:10:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也干过一样的事情被抓了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.29,0:10:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,约了你妈一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然最后的赢家是你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都说了不是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很令人火大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是在意那堵高墙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是在天国也像身处牢笼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好，现在我要说的是机密
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙外调查就快开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙外…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要到墙外去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗人的，怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.88,0:11:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为国民们不满的情绪日渐高涨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次议会应该就会通过了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真的要到墙外去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.71,0:11:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在召集调查兵团
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连，你想不想加入？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能找到新的土地
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:12:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能自由地选择住所了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.65,0:12:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,地震吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.65,0:12:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,地震不可能摇得这么厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙壁在摇晃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是外面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连，小心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的有…巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比墙还要高大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,太令人意外了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.34,0:13:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在高墙里不是很安全吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里好像有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住，就像训练那样行动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.15,0:13:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃！墙要垮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是镇上的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！快往这个方向逃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把炮对准巨人！瞄准巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,炮弹准备！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,炮弹准备！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚未获得火药使用许可
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了！别拖拖拉拉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别慌，像训练的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他们的表情…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.97,0:16:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备炮击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 炸翻这些巨人 - 是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,装填完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备发射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,命中目标
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说都是真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.03,0:17:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人有不死之身
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,再装填！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.73,0:18:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,班长！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.61,0:18:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,班长
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔敏！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.09,0:18:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种东西现在哪有用…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.43,0:19:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得先回家一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.67,0:20:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔敏，快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.61,0:20:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…不是阿尔敏的爸爸吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.07,0:20:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再推了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.58,0:21:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.92,0:21:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.83,0:21:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.23,0:21:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来，快站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.16,0:21:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行了，关门
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.01,0:21:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，米卡莎！快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.15,0:21:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.52,0:21:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,关门
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.65,0:22:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要关门？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.59,0:22:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,明明就还有空间
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.89,0:22:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不准把门打开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.56,0:22:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想保住自己的命，怎么可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.98,0:22:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎！米卡…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.92,0:22:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.93,0:22:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.91,0:22:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.16,0:23:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.29,0:24:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.82,0:26:09.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（2年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.20,0:26:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,长久以来的太平日子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.94,0:26:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是以惨剧作为代价交换来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.48,0:26:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,超乎想像的超大型巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.25,0:26:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏了蒙虔地区的外墙
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.93,0:26:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于大军压境的巨人们束手无策
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.27,0:26:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,被迫放弃了我们的农业地区
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.01,0:26:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退至中墙以内的工商地区
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.39,0:26:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大批的难民加上失去了农地
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.17,0:26:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,引发的粮食不足问题日益严重
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.51,0:26:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了取回被夺走的土地
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.89,0:27:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,修复被毁损的外墙是当务之急
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.30,0:27:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了进行这场光荣战役
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.21,0:27:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位已完成了所有训练
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.51,0:27:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汉吉兵器班长 - 是！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.26,0:27:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被巨人蹂躏的日子已经结束
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.47,0:27:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的我们有了立体机动装置
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.39,0:27:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了这个装置，我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.43,0:27:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定可以取得胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.54,0:27:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将在表町的中继点
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.32,0:27:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,与敷岛队长率领的侦查队会合
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.29,0:27:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,敷岛队长…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.46,0:27:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落时往蒙虔出发
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.07,0:27:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,期待各位英勇奋战以告慰英灵
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.11,0:27:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,献出心脏吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.48,0:28:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,献出心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.44,0:28:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会回来，妈妈就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.91,0:28:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里就交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.12,0:28:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这女儿总算是能尽点孝道了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.33,0:28:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,都快被你吃垮了，终于有点用
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.24,0:28:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎夏，快捡啊，我叫你快捡起来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.31,0:28:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 动作快
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.02,0:28:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，我的儿子，你要为我报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.62,0:28:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，为了光耀门楣
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.60,0:28:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的命献给英灵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.40,0:28:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰！约翰！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.08,0:28:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈只是离开一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.08,0:28:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要当个乖孩子，莉子
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.19,0:28:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉子
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.60,0:29:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要哭嘛，哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.01,0:29:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雪，这是什么？这是我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.28,0:29:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈，好像有点太胖了，别哭嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.37,0:29:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱哭鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.45,0:29:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有家人等着我们回来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.49,0:29:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,大哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.42,0:29:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个送你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.63,0:29:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.67,0:29:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雪，哥哥走罗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.11,0:29:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.35,0:29:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小雪，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.23,0:30:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.70,0:30:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,索达先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.71,0:30:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔敏
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.65,0:30:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.12,0:30:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是艾连吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.23,0:30:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.15,0:30:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.56,0:30:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.30,0:30:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.12,0:31:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.16,0:31:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.23,0:31:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.15,0:31:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要向那些家伙讨回来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.56,0:31:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要找巨人报仇？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.07,0:31:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只杀一两个根本无济于事
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.86,0:31:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么索达先生自愿加入呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.21,0:31:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了再见到我的老婆跟孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.88,0:31:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在等着我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.20,0:32:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.11,0:32:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.21,0:32:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.62,0:32:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问说完了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.57,0:32:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底有没有在听我说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.75,0:32:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好罗，现在蒙虔的外墙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.16,0:32:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样破了一个洞
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.83,0:32:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要炸掉这边，把下面填起来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.34,0:32:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然墙会变矮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.51,0:32:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是比巨人高
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.71,0:32:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们就过不来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.92,0:32:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以阻止更多巨人从外面进来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.43,0:32:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是外墙修复任务
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,填好墙后，歼灭墙内的巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.62,0:33:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎夏
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.36,0:33:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，先前的修复任务都失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.20,0:33:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达前就遭巨人袭击，弹药耗尽
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.92,0:33:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有足够的资源制作炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.85,0:33:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩表町的“最后的炸弹”
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.90,0:33:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们失败了，人类就会灭绝
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.22,0:33:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能背水一战了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.39,0:33:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不做也没差
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.51,0:33:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些小鬼只会碍手碍脚
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.25,0:33:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是针对你们，瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.92,0:33:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这群人根本是乌合之众
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.30,0:34:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争已经造成内耗好几年了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.61,0:34:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,新手越来越多也是迫不得已啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.55,0:34:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.65,0:34:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是就连调查兵团都会被歼灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.83,0:34:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些货色…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.24,0:34:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩无脑的大食洋芋女了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.32,0:34:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.36,0:34:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时候你还吃得下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.53,0:34:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思啊小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.67,0:34:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,农地不足
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.01,0:34:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说只要加入就可以吃饱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.42,0:34:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你够了没啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.29,0:34:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸妈就怕被你吃垮才把你卖了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.27,0:34:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都一样吧，无路可走才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.54,0:34:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你们一起我都要烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.88,0:34:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群只能送死的炮灰
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.92,0:35:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以别把死挂在嘴边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.30,0:35:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要，我不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.61,0:35:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉儿、莉儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.75,0:35:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怕，我会保护你的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.99,0:35:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴夫妻，闪一边去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.93,0:35:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来很不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.84,0:35:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为巨人实在太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.41,0:35:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,被盯上了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.72,0:35:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人根本连屁都不如
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.56,0:35:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人有乳头吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.70,0:35:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你巨人有乳头吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.71,0:35:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没看过倒是很会说大话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.89,0:35:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在内地长大的大少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.93,0:35:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再给我说一次看看
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.34,0:35:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有乳头！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.74,0:36:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有教过，巨人没有生殖器官
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.42,0:36:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们没有乳头
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.43,0:36:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,繁殖方法至今还是个谜
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.66,0:36:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然想解剖，但尸体马上就蒸发
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.37,0:36:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才想要活的巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.38,0:36:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好想要！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.76,0:36:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分钟后集合做装备检查
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.47,0:36:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.98,0:36:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了，讲到这个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.58,0:36:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在巨人面前丢下女友逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.86,0:36:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也没种吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.44,0:36:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了好了，住手
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.62,0:36:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩老是这样，真是冤家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.53,0:37:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑纳吉，放我下来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.67,0:37:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.48,0:37:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分钟后就要集合了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.62,0:37:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快，别拖拖拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.11,0:37:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.03,0:37:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怕
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.75,0:38:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是回老家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.22,0:38:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家不是在蒙虔吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.23,0:38:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都死光了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.70,0:38:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想回老家看看
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.81,0:38:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑纳吉，你是悠岩的农家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.51,0:38:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，我想回老家种田
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.66,0:38:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我弟弟跟妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.26,0:38:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意为了他们做任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.01,0:38:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是通往表町的旧街道
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.74,0:38:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.55,0:38:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人晚上睡觉，夜间视力不佳
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.02,0:38:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要抢在天亮前到达表町
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.22,0:38:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要严禁喧哗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.90,0:38:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人对人类的声音非常敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.67,0:38:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会引起其他巨人的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.07,0:38:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得自己快叫出来就把舌头咬断
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.01,0:38:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想死，就要在天亮前到达表町
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.58,0:38:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.69,0:39:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡过此门者，即舍弃一切希望
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.60,0:40:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要成功脱逃这个地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.97,0:40:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,表町的女神就在那里等着
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.94,0:40:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,女神？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.37,0:40:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道吗？敷岛队长的接班人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.88,0:40:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,号称巨人杀手的女班长
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.72,0:40:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在半年内杀了超过10个巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.93,0:40:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不叫女神而是死神吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.68,0:40:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我好害怕 - 有我在
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.96,0:41:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有动静
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.13,0:41:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.34,0:41:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了吗？也太快了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.79,0:41:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不对 - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.20,0:41:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没到表町
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.04,0:41:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认环境
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.00,0:41:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.48,0:42:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.95,0:42:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.12,0:42:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有状况，牛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.26,0:42:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来巨人只吃人类
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.07,0:42:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进，各班向前
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.26,0:42:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,洋芋女，巨人会被你吵醒
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.00,0:42:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这给你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.50,0:42:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.78,0:42:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也给你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.03,0:42:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你总是给我吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.90,0:42:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.27,0:42:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没看到巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.54,0:42:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天亮前应该可以到
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.78,0:43:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,少乌鸦嘴了，触霉头
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.16,0:43:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有异状，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.19,0:43:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有小孩的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.00,0:43:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有小孩落单了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.90,0:43:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说傻话了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.15,0:43:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能丢下他
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.59,0:43:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.82,0:43:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能丢下他
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.96,0:43:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,希雅娜
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.53,0:44:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有听到
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.00,0:44:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.28,0:44:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.96,0:45:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.32,0:46:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.26,0:46:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？他们在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.63,0:46:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴，别出声
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.60,0:46:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把巨人吵醒
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.34,0:46:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静，大家冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.58,0:46:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.15,0:46:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了，绝对不能…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.17,0:46:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大声喧哗！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.47,0:46:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.28,0:46:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,引来更多巨人了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.15,0:46:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.60,0:47:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.17,0:47:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.74,0:47:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，我们还没上车
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.74,0:47:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我们啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.15,0:47:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面就有更多高楼了，快跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.33,0:47:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不战斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.33,0:47:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 立体机动装置呢？ - 要打哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.80,0:47:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能正面对决啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.72,0:47:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！阿尔敏
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.67,0:47:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑纳吉
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.36,0:48:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别出声…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.40,0:48:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快到了，跑快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.27,0:48:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.31,0:48:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是表町啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.53,0:48:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人并不是不死之身
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.30,0:49:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍掉手脚或头部，也会马上再生
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.65,0:49:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯独这个部位
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.78,0:49:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦后颈部受重伤，就会毙命
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.76,0:49:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是用枪炮很难攻击这个部位
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.47,0:49:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,最有效的，就是这立体机动装置
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.68,0:49:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把装备穿在臀部
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.39,0:49:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以在空中高速移动
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.43,0:49:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,藉由固定器回旋升至巨人的高度
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.44,0:49:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持足够的高度瞄准后颈部下手
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.64,0:49:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，也要记得躲避巨人的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.82,0:49:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,再用替换式刀刃砍下后颈肉
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.79,0:49:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,后颈肉一旦被斩下，巨人就会死
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.20,0:49:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人死后尸体会马上蒸发消失
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.38,0:49:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一经验证打倒巨人的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.79,0:50:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是调查兵团的…敷岛队长
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.23,0:50:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能遇见不错的女巨人就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.89,0:50:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.93,0:51:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要绑紧罗，可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.31,0:51:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,库巴尔长官到了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.33,0:52:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,护送炸药真是辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.93,0:52:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来想确认一下里面装的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.38,0:52:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是打不开呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.03,0:52:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，那些炸药呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.44,0:52:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有听过叛乱的传闻吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.07,0:52:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.91,0:52:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就万无一失了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.58,0:53:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，这一直都是机密
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.69,0:53:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天亮之前要全部搬运完
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.60,0:53:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是仅存的炸药了，务必小心
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.46,0:53:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你害的，一切变得乱七八糟
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.90,0:53:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,想死你就自己去死
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.08,0:53:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,急着投胎的混帐
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.96,0:53:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好臭喔，大少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.51,0:53:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓到尿裤子了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.85,0:53:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人是不是很恐怖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.96,0:53:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.90,0:54:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.21,0:54:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连，住手
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.94,0:54:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,身手真慢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.05,0:54:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没你慢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.55,0:54:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.85,0:54:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.52,0:54:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再破坏规定了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.76,0:54:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.50,0:54:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是米卡莎吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.87,0:54:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.03,0:55:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才那脚很帅
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.63,0:55:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，是敷岛队长
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.21,0:55:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,以打闹来说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.11,0:55:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,新人叫什么名字啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.78,0:55:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连，我叫艾连
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.96,0:55:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.98,0:55:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来自蒙虔吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.86,0:55:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.53,0:55:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,都过世了，我当时太小不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.74,0:55:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.81,0:55:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问…米卡莎她…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.15,0:55:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么会？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.29,0:55:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.62,0:55:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.80,0:55:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把斩杀巨人当娱乐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.84,0:56:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是我教她的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.71,0:56:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来也非常想知道的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.22,0:56:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，我想要打倒巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.03,0:56:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.03,0:56:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我痛恨那些巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.91,0:56:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么痛恨？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.22,0:56:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他们害得我们必须躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.93,0:56:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,错了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.74,0:56:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.81,0:56:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是那些巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.25,0:56:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的敌人？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.07,0:56:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.21,0:56:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是安全
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.98,0:56:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怕被狼吃掉而躲在栅栏内生活的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.29,0:56:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么动物？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.37,0:57:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,家畜
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.67,0:57:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.38,0:57:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.25,0:57:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.82,0:57:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就飞出栅栏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.73,0:57:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.24,0:57:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有舍才有得
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.72,0:57:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送他这个的孩子已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.15,0:58:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说以前是有很多机械的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.46,0:58:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们甚至能飞在空中
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.27,0:58:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在都被禁止了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.19,0:58:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.10,0:58:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.94,0:58:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚说的那种技术
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.38,0:58:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后造成了什么后果你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.05,0:58:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏自然，浪费资源，引发战争
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.40,0:58:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.90,0:58:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.37,0:58:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.73,0:58:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,天一亮我们就往蒙虔方向出发
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.86,0:59:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前，好好休息，检查装备
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.41,0:59:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙从以前就只有打架厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.76,0:59:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,浑身酒味臭死了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.30,0:59:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底为什么这么讨厌他？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.17,0:59:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的脸…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.01,0:59:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像自己背负着全世界的不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.82,0:59:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是失去了他的女友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.86,0:59:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫做米卡莎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.47,1:00:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.21,1:00:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.13,1:00:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.87,1:00:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.87,1:00:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子被吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.32,1:01:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.19,1:01:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界是残酷的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.64,1:01:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只不过是杀几个巨人罢了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.69,1:02:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.93,1:02:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰你们了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.14,1:02:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.04,1:02:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.98,1:02:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.40,1:04:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又想引来巨人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.28,1:04:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.16,1:04:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该道歉的是我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.40,1:04:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.06,1:04:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟米卡莎班长怎么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.64,1:04:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么像个孩子一样
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.48,1:04:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟她已经是陌生人了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.29,1:04:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.32,1:04:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系啦，他们没有在看这边
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.50,1:04:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.33,1:04:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的背不痛吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.34,1:04:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉儿，我爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.58,1:04:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个，有办法结婚吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.13,1:05:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能活着回去的话吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.80,1:05:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,太奇怪了，结婚还需要许可
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.55,1:05:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算已经有小孩了也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.10,1:05:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉子
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.85,1:05:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有个女儿对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.80,1:05:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,志愿加入就可以得到养育补助
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.39,1:05:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你讨厌单亲妈妈吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.47,1:06:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意当我女儿的父亲吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.52,1:06:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想死！放开我！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.76,1:06:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉子！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.89,1:07:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被包围了，敌人来袭！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.29,1:07:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人来袭！敌人来袭！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.50,1:07:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉儿！莉儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.88,1:07:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快穿上立体机动装置！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.99,1:07:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莉儿，走罗 - 等我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.27,1:07:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要守住炸药！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.38,1:07:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边太窄了没办法发射固定器
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.45,1:07:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,立体机动兵快到屋顶去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.43,1:07:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.04,1:08:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,前方有四只，你从左边切入
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.35,1:08:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.51,1:08:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别慌，就算死到临头也要有格调
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.68,1:09:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！我叫你快点过来！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.46,1:09:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是炸药，听到没！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.79,1:09:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价守护炸药
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.34,1:09:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边已经守不住了，撤退！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.56,1:10:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快起来啊，快点醒过来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.44,1:10:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你快点起来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.88,1:10:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐，这里很危险，来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.72,1:10:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，可以帮我一起抬他吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.66,1:10:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾，你男友已经…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.38,1:10:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,福士…我不要
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.03,1:10:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.90,1:10:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我，你放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.60,1:10:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了那些巨人，全都杀光
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.09,1:10:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.07,1:10:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.34,1:10:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是谁在驾驶？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.84,1:11:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有得到许可！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.74,1:11:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有小偷！有人要偷炸药！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.52,1:11:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来！快停车！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.56,1:11:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.37,1:11:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人都去死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.77,1:12:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拦下来！拦下来！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.64,1:12:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么烧起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.77,1:12:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拦下它！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.75,1:12:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,被我找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.55,1:12:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把巨人全杀光
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.57,1:12:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快趴下！快趴下！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.57,1:12:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,福士…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.16,1:12:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是美丽啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.64,1:12:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是浪费了点
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.95,1:12:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸药…我们仅存的炸药！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.46,1:12:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！你想死吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.57,1:12:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会变成这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.79,1:13:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是那个炸弹小偷的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.68,1:13:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是地狱啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.00,1:13:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.02,1:13:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.86,1:13:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,太脆弱了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.81,1:14:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会被吃掉
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.05,1:14:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁现在，快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.79,1:14:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怕被狼吃掉而躲在栅栏内生活的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.10,1:14:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么动物？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.00,1:14:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,家畜
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.24,1:14:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.81,1:14:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.98,1:14:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就飞出栅栏吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.22,1:14:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.30,1:14:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不通的，我们根本毫无胜算
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.98,1:14:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你这辈子就只能这样了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.05,1:14:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，艾连
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.12,1:15:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.87,1:15:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.74,1:15:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕被抓到就无法靠近他们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.64,1:15:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞向敌人的怀里
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.35,1:15:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.78,1:15:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可惜
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.15,1:15:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有伤到目标
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.18,1:15:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得一定要给他致命一击
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.99,1:15:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.63,1:15:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,到手了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.16,1:16:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是要看运气啦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.15,1:16:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.25,1:16:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看那边
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.29,1:16:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.77,1:16:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙只会说大话
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.87,1:16:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家，我有个计划
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.38,1:16:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲低一点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.76,1:17:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些大块头，想多吃点吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.36,1:17:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吃我啊笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.93,1:17:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的胃根本就是无底洞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.34,1:17:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你一脸蠢样，生气了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.95,1:17:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,索达先生，够了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.19,1:17:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.46,1:17:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊，你来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.86,1:17:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.18,1:17:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.79,1:18:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让拎北不爽
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.33,1:18:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.96,1:18:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.34,1:18:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.07,1:18:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该死在某个地方了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.51,1:18:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔敏
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.28,1:19:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔敏…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.52,1:19:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行啊，没用
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.54,1:19:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔敏！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.47,1:20:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔敏
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.92,1:20:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让均耍
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.19,1:20:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,死在这种地方的！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.01,1:20:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.18,1:20:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔敏
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.47,1:21:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,希雅娜
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.32,1:22:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你们全都驱逐
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.18,1:22:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里已经完了，全都是巨人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.35,1:22:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉有什么在召集它们
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.45,1:22:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,敷岛队长呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.56,1:22:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该还在奋战吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.03,1:22:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官跟亲卫队他们呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.30,1:22:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经先去避难了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.77,1:22:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,该不会是拿我们做诱饵
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.51,1:22:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃啊小南
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.07,1:22:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.35,1:22:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连被吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.34,1:22:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我害的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.15,1:23:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.48,1:23:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来开路逃离这里
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.52,1:23:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务没变，打倒巨人
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.16,1:23:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行啦！你已经没有瓦斯了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.81,1:24:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.22,1:25:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？那是什么声音？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.80,1:25:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.65,1:25:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人攻击巨人？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.43,1:25:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.97,1:25:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的手，再生速度太快了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.00,1:26:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开始围过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.10,1:27:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们这边的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.32,1:27:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他的动作，他是有思考能力的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.73,1:27:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没看过这样的巨人啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.70,1:27:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.63,1:28:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎，快退后啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.05,1:28:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底站在哪一边啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.89,1:28:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.04,1:28:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.88,1:29:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.45,1:29:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事吧？ - 站得起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.81,1:29:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.62,1:29:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于精疲力尽了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.89,1:29:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见了！不见了啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.26,1:29:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,烫死了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.50,1:29:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,切开它的后颈，但别伤到里面
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.47,1:29:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.17,1:29:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,照做就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.61,1:29:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不快点会被巨人吞噬
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.78,1:30:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,连细胞都会被同化了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.12,1:30:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是艾连吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.12,1:30:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.66,1:30:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.84,1:30:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以后颈才会是要害
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.99,1:30:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对付怪物的人
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.26,1:30:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心自己也成了怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.71,1:32:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是人类还是巨人？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.02,1:32:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾连是人类最后的希望
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.36,1:32:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是家畜
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.63,1:32:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道触发细胞分裂的关键
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.13,1:32:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们志同道合
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.00,1:32:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他靠意识操控本能
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.91,1:32:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏的芽就要拔除
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.71,1:32:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能解开巨人之谜
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.35,1:32:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等你
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.75,1:32:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿献出心脏效命！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.12,1:32:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我，你们早死光了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.99,1:32:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再失去谁了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.83,1:32:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起战斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.97,1:32:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,舍弃要守护的，就会变强
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.14,1:33:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道世界的真相！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.38,1:33:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.35,1:33:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是万中选一
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.12,1:33:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对你的儿子下手？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.25,1:33:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.29,1:33:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,战到最后，我们不会输！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.73,1:33:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,高墙的另一边是地狱啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.07,1:33:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会永远在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.40,1:33:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,米卡莎！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.18,1:33:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等的就是这一天！
